<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets call warrants on red-chip basket.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets call warrants on red-chip basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Friday it has launched 600 million call warrants on a basket of three red chip stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> China Merchant Hai Hong Holdings Ltd     0.15 shrs</p>
<p> China Everbright-IHD pacific Ltd	   0.15 shrs</p>
<p> China Resources Enterprise Ltd	     0.15 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrant control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$4.239	 PREMIUM	 19.98 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.156	 GEARING	 3.1x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   24.APR.98	MIN EXER LOT  50,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$4.833</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
